WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.609
A callout is a public post on pump.

00:00:02.609 --> 00:00:04.675
fun that says you are in a coin.

00:00:04.675 --> 00:00:08.936
Auto-callout posts one for you, every time you buy, from the pump.

00:00:08.936 --> 00:00:11.389
fun account of the wallet that bought.

00:00:11.389 --> 00:00:12.422
You need a pump.

00:00:12.422 --> 00:00:13.584
fun account first.

00:00:13.584 --> 00:00:16.360
If you do not have one yet, watch the pump.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:17.909
fun account video first.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:22.158
Start on the Hub, the home screen with the big tiles.

00:00:22.158 --> 00:00:23.120
Click Automation.

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:26.795
In the menu on the left, click Auto-callout.

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:29.708
Scroll down to What to say.

00:00:29.708 --> 00:00:32.226
Type a few short lines, one on each line.

00:00:32.226 --> 00:00:34.130
For example, early on this one.

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:35.603
Or, like the chart here.

00:00:35.603 --> 00:00:40.393
Each callout picks one line at random, so your posts do not all look the same.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.437
You can also use these words in curly brackets.

00:00:44.437 --> 00:00:46.461
Ticker turns into the coin's name.

00:00:46.461 --> 00:00:48.187
MC turns into its market cap.

00:00:48.187 --> 00:00:50.686
The app fills in the real numbers for you.

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.255
When you are happy with your lines, click Save.

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:59.688
Now scroll back up to When to call, and turn on Call out what I buy.

00:00:59.688 --> 00:01:03.007
From now on, every real buy from a wallet with a pump.

00:01:03.007 --> 00:01:04.666
fun account gets a callout.

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:10.209
If you do not want to call out tiny buys, type an amount in Skip buys under.

00:01:10.209 --> 00:01:12.579
Buys smaller than that will not be called.

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:20.592
If you launch your own coins, Call out coins I launch posts a callout on those too, a moment after the launch.

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:24.527
Want your callouts in your Discord server too?

00:01:24.527 --> 00:01:30.370
In Discord, open your channel settings, then Integrations, then Webhooks, and copy the webhook link.

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:32.590
Paste it here, and click Save webhook.

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:34.783
Once your pump.

00:01:34.783 --> 00:01:40.319
fun account is signed in, a box called Post one now shows up at the bottom of this page.

00:01:40.319 --> 00:01:44.218
Use it to post one real callout, and see exactly how it looks.

00:01:45.470 --> 00:01:46.170
That is it.

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:50.119
Write a few lines, save them, and turn on Call out what I buy.

00:01:50.119 --> 00:01:52.984
Only real buys get a callout, not paper ones.

00:01:52.984 --> 00:01:56.232
And remember, callouts are public, under your name.
